# The upstream Keycloak image, pinned by digest. TDD-identity-kernel-005.
#
# A tag is mutable: `26.7.5` can point at different bytes tomorrow, and a proof-of-concept answer
# recorded against a tag is an answer about an image nobody can fetch again. The digest is the
# identity; the version is recorded beside it for the reader.
#
# Resolved from quay.io's registry API on 2026-10-01 (26.7.5, published 2026-09-30; the manifest
# list digest, as 26.7.4's was). Changing it is an upgrade, and an upgrade runs the compatibility
# suite in compat/ and the upgrade job before it is accepted. image/keycloak.previous.ref changes
# with it, to the digest this one replaces.
#
# The first non-comment line is the reference CI runs.
quay.io/keycloak/keycloak@sha256:37dbaf6f0722c9ec246335f36e1ef8b2e6cb960f7c27e0d8c615121a3d475a85
